  static-shape before and after `ensure_shape` is applied.

  >>> @tf.function
  ... def f(tensor):
  ...   print("Static-shape before:", tensor.shape)
  ...   tensor = tf.ensure_shape(tensor, [None, 3])
  ...   print("Static-shape after:", tensor.shape)
  ...   return tensor

